<title>USA: Quality Dining hires Moreton as CFO.</title>
<headline>Quality Dining hires Moreton as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MISHAWAKA, Ind. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quality Dining Inc said it hired William Moreton as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He was previously chief financial officer of Gilbert/Robinson Restaurants Inc, the owner of the Houlihan's and Darryl's casual dining chains.</p>
<p>Moreton replaces Michael Sosinski, who resigned November 1. Quality Dining owns the Bruegger's Bagel Bakery, Grady's American Grill, Spageddies Italian Kitchen and Papa Vino's Italian Kitchen chains and operates Burger King restaurants and Chili's Grill &amp; Bar restaurants as a franchisee.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
